    {
      "text": "A line chart titled \"EPI: Completeness - last 5 years\" for Trainingland, the WHO immunisation monthly report reporting rate by year, 2011 to 2015. Data exist only for 2013 (62.8%), 2014 (71.8%) and 2015 (77.3%), rising each year.",
